	    68% (solid line) and 95% (dashed line) CL contours for $ -2\ln\Delta\mathcal{L} $ as functions of the reported dim-6 Wilson coefficient pairs, both expected (black) and observed (orange). All results are obtained by considering the combination of all the channels, fixing the operators not under analysis to zero. A full table showing all pairs of operatoprs is reported in appendix 15. 
