	    $ -2\ln\Delta\mathcal{L} $ observed scans for the six bosonic operators, fully profiled. The profiled combination fits (solid black line) were performed leaving all of the operators not under study freely floating, as well as all of the nuisance parameters. They are shown in comparison to the individual fit (red dashed line), in which all of the operators not under study are fixed to zero. Horizontal lines represent the 95% and 68% CL. 
	  </td>
	</tr>

